# Line endings are normalised in the repository, not on each machine: contributors and CI run
# on different platforms, and the gates (`check-local-only`, `check:size`) read file text.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never converted, never diffed as text. The icons are auditable geometry
# (`scripts/generate-icons.mjs`), not opaque binaries, but a PNG is still not text; the fixture
# certificate and key are read byte-for-byte by the e2e HTTPS server.
*.png binary
*.pem binary
